# Three simulated drives on the portal (machine/portal.portal): enable,
# hold, a 550 x 550 mm diagonal in 0.8 s (smooth, peak 1.3 m/s per axis,
# 0.7 g), hold. The scales follow; the tool head lags and rings on its
# springs (hy: Y at mid-span, the softest); the frame rocks on its feet
# and the reaction reaches the floor.
@todo master's F3 voltage limit (DEBUGNOTES 2026-10-26 "Portal: the linear motors run out of bus voltage")
@program portal/portal_sim
@args portal/machine/portal.portal
run 0.05
lcnc 1
run 0.3
move 0.3 200 200
run 0.3
mark
move 0.8 750 750
print max_ferr_x max_ferr_y1 max_ferr_y2 max_econt max_hx max_hy max_rack max_frame_y max_feet_y max_cur_y1 max_cur_x
run 0.5
print x y1 y2 tx ty etool fault jammed hits
@expect max portal.max_ferr_x < 300
@expect max portal.max_ferr_y1 < 300
@expect max portal.max_hy > 100
@expect max portal.max_frame_y > 50
@expect max portal.max_feet_y > 200
@expect max portal.max_econt < 100
@expect max portal.max_rack < 200
@expect portal.x ~ 750 0.005
@expect portal.y1 ~ 750 0.005
@expect portal.y2 ~ 750 0.005
@expect portal.etool < 10
@expect portal.fault == 0
@expect portal.jammed == 0
@expect portal.hits == 0
@reject ^ERROR
